sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Staff member
  participant K as Kiosk (React)
  participant A as API (Express)
  participant F as Face service (Python)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  K->>A: GET /face/challenge
  A-->>K: random two-step head-turn sequence (e.g. right then left), signed token (90 s)
  S->>K: stands in front of the camera
  K->>K: capture 3 frontal frames, then 4 frames for each turn (11 frames)
  K->>A: POST /face/check (frames, challenge token)
  A->>A: verify token and kiosk user
  A->>F: POST /process (frames, challenge)
  F->>F: single face, same person, turns in the requested directions and order (liveness)
  F-->>A: embedding vector (128 values)
  Note over F: images discarded immediately
  A->>D: load encrypted embeddings of this school
  D-->>A: AES-256-GCM ciphertexts
  A->>A: decrypt, cosine similarity, single threshold
  A->>D: insert attendance event (IN or OUT by last movement), match score
  A-->>K: employee name, event type, time
